  "description": "A new anime adaptation of Rumiko Takahashi's <i>Ranma 1/2</i>.\n<br><br>\nRanma Saotome and Akane Tendou of Tendou Dojo are betrothed to each other by their parents. But Ranma faces a unique problem…<br><br>\n\nEver since he fell into the cursed springs of Jusenkyo while training in China, his body has acquired the peculiar trait of transforming into a girl when doused with cold water and reverting to a boy with hot water.<br><br>\n\nGet ready for the slapstick, action-packed rom com featuring Ranma, Akane, and a vibrant cast of unique characters!<br><br>\n(Source: Ranma 1/2 PR Official Site, edited)",
